  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The African Union Election Assistance Unit is responsible for the     implementation of the AFrican Union programme for the promotion of    Democratic elections. The main objective of this support to enhance   AU&apos;s election observation systems, build the capacity of election     managment bodies and institutionalize transparent settlement of       disbutes, ultimately fostering peaceful elections in Africa.</narrative>
